# Authentication API Endpoints
# Use with VS Code REST Client or HTTP Client extension

@baseUrl = http://localhost:48217

### 1. User Signup
# @name signup
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "yeasin_user",
  "password": "password123",
  "fcmToken": "sample_fcm_device_token_123"
}

### 2. User Signup Validation Error (Short Username)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "yo",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. User Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "yeasin_user",
  "password": "password123",
  "fcmToken": "sample_fcm_device_token_updated"
}

### 4. User Login (Invalid Credentials)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "yeasin_user",
  "password": "wrong_password"
}

### 5. Get Current User Profile (Requires Bearer Token)
# Replace {{login.response.body.data.token}} with actual token or use response variable
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. Get Current User Profile (Unauthorized / No Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
